english.CredentialUserMismatch=These AgentDock credentials belong to a different Windows user. Run Setup from the original user account or perform a clean reinstall.
english.InstallerStartFailed=Could not start the AgentDock installer.
english.InstallerExitCode=Installer exit code:
english.InstallFailed=AgentDock installation failed:
english.ElevatedSetupUnsupported=Start AgentDock Setup normally. Do not use Run as administrator. Setup requests UAC only when it needs to clean up an old scheduled task or enable administrator-enhanced core mode.
english.ElevatedModeFallbackNotice=Windows could not enable administrator-enhanced core mode. AgentDock continued in standard user mode; normal local use is unaffected. If you need administrator-enhanced mode, check your Windows/UAC policy and enable it later.
english.PurgeStateQuestion=Also delete AgentDock user data and settings? Choose No to keep Skills, configuration, and the default working directory.
english.UninstallScriptMissing=The AgentDock uninstall script is missing.
english.UninstallScriptFailed=The AgentDock cleanup script failed with exit code:
