english.OfflineProgressDescription=Setup is configuring AgentDock. Please wait while installation completes.
english.OfflineProgressPreparing=Preparing AgentDock...
english.RuntimeProgressChecking=Checking required Microsoft runtimes...
english.RuntimeInstallFailed=Required Microsoft Runtime setup failed:
english.OfflineProgressApplying=Installing AgentDock and applying your settings...
english.OfflineProgressFinishing=Finishing AgentDock installation...
english.FinishedControlPanel=Installation is complete. Open AgentDock from the Start menu or desktop shortcut.
english.FinishedDeferredControlPanel=Installation is complete. Open AgentDock from the Start menu or desktop shortcut. If AgentDock does not start automatically, sign in to Windows again and try again.
